# Typography

## Family

- **Only** Plus Jakarta Sans (variable font in `public/assets/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-VariableFont_wght.ttf` or `next/font/local`)
- Wire as `--font-sans` / `font-sans` on `<body>`
- Never Geist, Inter, Arial defaults, or `font-inter`

## Weights

| Weight | Class | Use |
|--------|-------|-----|
| 400 | `font-normal` | Body / hero copy |
| 500 | `font-medium` | Sparse supporting text |
| 600 | `font-semibold` | Nav links, some H2 / pills |
| 700 | `font-bold` | Default headlines & CTAs |
| 800 | `font-extrabold` | Rare emphasis (marquees / form titles) |

Load 400–800; do not invent 300 unless a Design page requires it.

## Color roles

| Role | Class |
|------|-------|
| Default text | `text-navy` |
| Accent / eyebrow | `text-teal` |
| On navy hero | `text-white` |
| Muted | `text-gray-600` / `#374151` sparingly |
| Stat / tab accent | `text-orange` |

Prefer token classes over arbitrary hex.

## Patterns

```tsx
// Eyebrow
<p className="text-sm uppercase tracking-widest text-teal font-semibold">…</p>

// Section title
<h2 className="text-2xl sm:text-3xl lg:text-[28px] font-bold leading-tight lg:leading-[36px] text-navy">…</h2>

// Body
<p className="text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-[20px] leading-relaxed lg:leading-[28px] text-navy/80">…</p>
```

## Semantic HTML

Use real `h1`–`h3` / `p` for SEO. Styling classes must not replace heading tags with bare `div`/`span` for titles.
